{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5074": "MAIMUN: 你好，尼古拉，有件事想问问你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5075": "NIKOLAI: 我……认识你？这是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5076": "MAIMUN: 别慌，你还在睡梦中，不过很快就要醒了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5077": "MAIMUN: 我叫迈蒙，很久以前是个教师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5078": "NIKOLAI: 很久以前？那你现在怎么会在这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5079": "MAIMUN: 如今的我，是齐卡隆体内的一段记忆。保存这样的记忆，也是他的使命之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5080": "MAIMUN: 好了，说正事吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5081": "NIKOLAI: 我不想再看一遍了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5082": "MAIMUN: 科尼茨为什么会落得如此下场？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5083": "NIKOLAI: 你说呢？战时公然反抗指挥官，才把自己害死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5084": "MAIMUN: 我不是这个意思，我想问，他为什么会让自己走到这一步？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5085": "NIKOLAI: 你们都死了，怎么不去问他？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5086": "MAIMUN: 能否这样说：面对城里人的遭遇，他既愤怒，又怜悯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5087": "NIKOLAI: 我怎么知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5088": "MAIMUN: 因为你也有同样的感受。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5089": "MAIMUN: 愤怒与怜悯都是人自然会有的情感，但也有人感受得过于强烈，科尼茨当时便是如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5090": "MAIMUN: 也有人感受得太少，就像你当时那样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5091": "NIKOLAI: 这么说不公平。你明明看见我在帮他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5092": "MAIMUN: 你能做的不止这些。你原本可以叫他们躲进地下室。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5093": "NIKOLAI: 火会把地下室里的空气耗光。他们躲进去也活不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5094": "MAIMUN: 尼古拉，我能看见你的记忆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5095": "MAIMUN: 你想到过花几分钟挖一条简陋的通风道，我们都知道，你本来能这样做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5096": "NIKOLAI: 我后来不是已经弥补了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5097": "NIKOLAI: 我现在正帮他们的邻居逃命，为了这事，我把自己的人生都搭进去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5098": "MAIMUN: 德性关乎情感与行动。怜悯和愤怒过了头，会招致失败；可若是太少，也一样会失败。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5099": "NIKOLAI: 你到底在不在听我说话？究竟想说什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5100": "MAIMUN: 要作出正确的选择，就得在过度与不足之间，找到恰当的分寸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5101": "MAIMUN: 总有一天，你会情绪激荡，到时要把握住这样的分寸，就会格外困难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5102": "MAIMUN: 即便如此，你也必须坚持走这条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5103": "NIKOLAI: “情感”，“德性”……真好，真是聊得太好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5104": "NIKOLAI: （我梦游了？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5105": "NIKOLAI: 别再这样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5106": "YOUNG MAN: 普罗赫先生！我们的粮食被偷了一些！是……绿色的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5107": "NIKOLAI: （该死……粮食本来就不多了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5108": "NIKOLAI: 往哪儿去了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5109": "YOUNG MAN: 西南边那条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6Start-5110": "NIKOLAI: 好，该你出点力了，走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5111": "NIKOLAI: 到此为止。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5112": "NIKOLAI: 我还以为，军队里的麻烦已经够没完没了了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5113": "PAVEL: 普罗赫上士！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5114": "NIKOLAI: 别这么叫我，出什么事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5115": "PAVEL: 我们兄弟俩看见了卡车！军用卡车！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5116": "NIKOLAI: 多远？数过有多少兵吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5117": "MATEUSZ: 车里装的不是兵，是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5118": "MATEUSZ: 有我们的邻居，泽林斯基一家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5119": "PAVEL: 还有多萝塔·沃伊奇克，就是我第一个……她家人好像也在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5120": "MATEUSZ: 七八辆车，全是被抓的雷津人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5121": "MATEUSZ: 他们进了西北边的树林。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-goblins1-5122": "NIKOLAI: 好，既然附近有军队活动，我们就得侦察一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5123": "NIKOLAI: 看来他们遭到了伏击。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5124": "MATEUSZ: 不是刚才那队，这些全是物资。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5125": "PAVEL: 我们用得上那些东西，尤其是卡车。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5126": "NIKOLAI: 先别急。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5127": "NIKOLAI: 可以出来了，我们不是军队的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5128": "APINGORIX: 奥斯伦人，你倒没看起来那么蠢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5129": "APINGORIX: 等等，我认得你，你换阵营了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5130": "NIKOLAI: 我不想解释。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5131": "NIKOLAI: 看来，这车队里没有你想找的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5132": "APINGORIX: 你不也没找到吗？不过我知道他们要把俘虏押到哪儿去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5133": "NIKOLAI: 是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5134": "APINGORIX: 听着，四周树上都是我的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5135": "APINGORIX: 可我不想杀你，你活着对我更有用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5136": "APINGORIX: 到前面的空地来，我让你看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5137": "MATEUSZ: 他不会说真话的，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5138": "NIKOLAI: 至少有一点他没说错，这儿是他的地盘，真想杀我们，他办得到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5139": "NIKOLAI: 不妨先听听他有什么打算，你能回去给贝克医生报个信吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5140": "PAVEL: 我去，马上回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-convoyRuins-5141": "NIKOLAI: （不知道原先在想什么，不过肯定没想到是这个。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5142": "APINGORIX: 还等什么？过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5143": "NIKOLAI: 那是……军事基地？什么时候建的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5144": "APINGORIX: 不久前。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5145": "APINGORIX: 人一车一车地往里送，却从不往外运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5146": "NIKOLAI: 里面有你的人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5147": "APINGORIX: 对，所以才用得着你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5148": "APINGORIX: 你正带难民往西走，去山里的村子，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5149": "NIKOLAI: 无可奉告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5150": "APINGORIX: 我们盯着你的车队一星期了，知道你们要去哪儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5151": "APINGORIX: 帮我把人救出来，军队就会忙着找我，顾不上找你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5152": "APINGORIX: 我们伏击的车队，是给你刚看见的营地送维修物资的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5153": "NIKOLAI: 所以你需要一个能冒充维修队长的奥斯伦人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5154": "APINGORIX: 就说了，你没看起来那么蠢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5155": "APINGORIX: 只要替我把一样东西偷偷送到我的人手里，再制造点骚动，剩下的我们来办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5156": "APINGORIX: 快作决定，车队这么久没到，他们该起疑了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5157": "BEKKER: 简直荒唐，我知道那种人的嘴脸，为了达到目的，什么都说得出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5158": "NIKOLAI: 听着，我们还能活着，全因为阿平戈里克斯觉得我们有用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5159": "NIKOLAI: 进了营地，至少我能多掌握一点主动权。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5160": "MATEUSZ: 你真能骗过整座基地？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5161": "NIKOLAI: 要说有什么是我最熟悉的，那就是怎么当个军士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5162": "NIKOLAI: 不过，你们两个也得跟我一起进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5163": "NIKOLAI: 毕竟一个军士，总得带着自己的班才像样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5164": "MATEUSZ: 什么……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5165": "BEKKER: 真让人反胃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5166": "BEKKER: 要是你们被抓，难民就没人保护了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5167": "NIKOLAI: 医生，要是不答应阿平戈里克斯，他就会把难民全杀了，或者抓去当奴隶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5168": "NIKOLAI: 这是眼下最好的办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5169": "PAVEL: 我去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5170": "PAVEL: 邻居们都在里面，可能还有我们的亲戚，我们不能坐着不管。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5171": "BEKKER: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-viewCampCliff-5172": "NIKOLAI: 我去告诉阿平戈里克斯，我们答应了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5173": "APINGORIX: 准备好了？一旦进去，没完成你的任务，我们就没法把你弄出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5174": "还没。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5175": "APINGORIX: 那就快点！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5176": "是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5177": "APINGORIX: 很好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5178": "NIKOLAI: 行，让我把衣服穿好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5179": "NIKOLAI: 这军装不太合身……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5180": "NIKOLAI: 好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5181": "MATEUSZ: 我总觉得自己看起来不够凶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5182": "NIKOLAI: 相信我，奥斯伦军队里软弱又爱抱怨的家伙多得是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5183": "PAVEL: 可为什么还得把自己的衣服穿在军装下面？我都出汗了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5184": "NIKOLAI: 阿平戈里克斯来闹的时候，可能得马上换回去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5185": "PAVEL: 那它呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5186": "NIKOLAI: 它？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5187": "ZIKARON: ……变化……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5188": "NIKOLAI: 它总能让人吃惊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-apingorixEnterCamp-5189": "NIKOLAI: 好，还有任务要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-cantLeavePrisonCamp-5190": "NIKOLAI: 这里还没办完。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campRuinsRemark-5191": "NIKOLAI: （拘禁营里怎么会有古代遗迹？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campRuinsRemark-5192": "DREYFUSS: 那边那个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campRuinsRemark-5193": "DREYFUSS: 不，别看我，守卫盯着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campRuinsRemark-5194": "DREYFUSS: 把阿平戈里克斯给你的东西放下，别太显眼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campRuinsRemark-5195": "DREYFUSS: 现在快去办他交代的其他事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsBlocker-5196": "GUARD: 没有指挥官许可，谁都不准进幽灵区。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsBlocker-5197": "GUARD: 他应该在控制中心附近。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5198": "NIKOLAI: 报告长官，前来报到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5199": "COMMANDER: 你们就是维修队？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5200": "NIKOLAI: 是，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5201": "COMMANDER: 幸好你们赶在冯·罗尔主任前面到了，你知道他是什么脾气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5202": "NIKOLAI: 还没那份荣幸，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5203": "COMMANDER: 任务说明听过了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5204": "NIKOLAI: 没有，长官，我们从前线匆忙赶来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5205": "COMMANDER: 果然，去发电区的楼梯在中枢区域的西南角。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5206": "COMMANDER: 发电机必须恢复满负荷运行，其他细节问技术员，去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campCommander1-5207": "NIKOLAI: 是，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5208": "TECH: 你们就是维修班吧？欢迎来到幽区。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5209": "NIKOLAI: 幽区？作战手册里有这个叫法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5210": "TECH: 啊，没有，这只是我们私下的简称，都管这里叫“幽灵区”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5211": "TECH: 不过，这个名字……尽量别外传。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5212": "NIKOLAI: 这里有幽灵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5213": "TECH: 军方的正式说法，是幽灵不存在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5214": "TECH: 可之前派来的两支维修队……都没能走到发电机那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5215": "TECH: 好在这次来的是你们，看装备，可比他们强多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5216": "TECH: 这地方几乎没人维护过，要找到通往发电机的路，就祝你们好运了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsIntro-5217": "NIKOLAI: （至少不会有人盯得太紧。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-weCanJumpThat-5218": "NIKOLAI: （地板有缺口？应该跳得过去。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5219": "NIKOLAI: 不行，太热了。得把军装脱掉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5220": "NIKOLAI: 这到底是谁，或者什么东西弄出来的……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5221": "CORDELIA: 环境虽差，能重新活动活动，倒也不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5222": "JEROME: 最好别太勉强。没用血清，感染未必彻底消除了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5223": "JEROME: 再说，马吉特那台机器是否还留下了别的隐患，谁也说不准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5224": "CORDELIA: 幸好有位高明的医生同行，而我也神志清醒，行动自如。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5225": "CORDELIA: 不过，不把这些元素体清掉，我们很快就会被淹没。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-jumpAndChangeClothes-5226": "CORDELIA: 在屋里走上一圈，总不至于累坏吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5227": "CORDELIA: 我觉得，处理得相当不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5228": "NIKOLAI: 刚才那几招，真够漂亮的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5229": "CORDELIA: 什么？怎么会！？我们为什么没察觉他们的魔力？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5230": "NIKOLAI: 首先，我不会魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5231": "NIKOLAI: 至于齐卡隆……它的情况，我们也不太清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5232": "CORDELIA: 他们听得懂莱奥尼亚语！换里恩语！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5233": "JEROME: 你的里恩语，恐怕不够用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5234": "CORDELIA: 这时候，不许对我取笑！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5235": "NIKOLAI: 我们还是听得懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5236": "CORDELIA: 我……呃……你还有说那个埃特伦语？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5237": "JEROME: 我从医学院以后，就没有说这个埃特伦语。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5238": "NIKOLAI: 说什么语言都一样。齐卡隆好像几乎什么都能翻译。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5239": "JEROME: 如果不介意，能告诉我们各位是谁吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5240": "NIKOLAI: 我是本地人，你们不是。先从这里说起吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5241": "NIKOLAI: 这一切是你们弄的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5242": "JEROME: 不是，我们只是用魔法干扰了这里的机器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5243": "JEROME: 至于这些雾气和元素生物，只能算是……附带的结果。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5244": "NIKOLAI: 嗯，我们打算救人出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5245": "NIKOLAI: 看来你们也被困住了，愿意的话可以一起走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5246": "NIKOLAI: 多一分助力是一分。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5247": "CORDELIA: （我们不会真要答应这个陌生人吧？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5248": "JEROME: （他们看着确实不像士兵。而且，我们也没多少选择。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5249": "JEROME: （再说，你从来不怕冒险。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5250": "CORDELIA: （那也得是靠我自己去应对的风险。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5251": "CORDELIA: （而不是把希望寄托在一个来历、动机都不清楚的人身上。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5252": "JEROME: （信不信他是一回事。至少得弄清，他到这里来做什么吧？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5253": "CORDELIA: 好吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5254": "CORDELIA: 你们是要去发电机那里？路上有些……危险。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikoCordelia-5255": "NIKOLAI: 是吗？正好，有你们带路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5256": "NIKOLAI: 发电机和通风设备，我倒懂一点……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5257": "NIKOLAI: 可没见过这样的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5258": "JEROME: 它们既能用燃料，也能用魔力驱动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5259": "PAVEL: 连奥斯伦语都不会，你怎么知道它的原理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5260": "JEROME: 这些东西都来自我们的国家，至少原型机和其中许多零件是从那里来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5261": "JEROME: 这种技术，在我们那里很常见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5262": "NIKOLAI: 嗯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5263": "NIKOLAI: 好，那就把它开起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5264": "NIKOLAI: 这声音可不妙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5265": "NIKOLAI: 只要把废气重新接进通风系统……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5266": "NIKOLAI: 这样就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5267": "NIKOLAI: 得回楼上报告，不然指挥官会起疑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5268": "NIKOLAI: 你们两个留在这里，等着闻到废气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5269": "JEROME: 去楼梯的近路应该清出来了，就在我们南边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ghostSectorBossScene-5270": "NIKOLAI: 穿回军装，走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsNotDoneYet-5271": "CORDELIA: 不，我坚持。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-forestCampUTurn-5272": "NIKOLAI: （不，不是这边。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5273": "CORDELIA: 那么，你有什么计划，先生……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5274": "NIKOLAI: 反正语言不通，他们也问不出什么，那就……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5275": "NIKOLAI: 我叫尼古拉·普罗赫。以前在奥斯伦军队服役。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5276": "CORDELIA: 奥斯伦？你是说……古代的奥斯伦帝国？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5277": "NIKOLAI: 对。不然你以为这是哪儿？没发现大家都说奥斯伦语？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5278": "CORDELIA: 我只在古书里见过你们的语言。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5279": "NIKOLAI: 我最好还是别知道你们是谁。万一我没能逃出去，也免得牵连你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5280": "NIKOLAI: 计划是把发电机开到满负荷，再把废气排回基地里面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5281": "NIKOLAI: 到时候楼里的人光顾着处理这个，就不会留意我们救人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5282": "NIKOLAI: 不过……这控制面板好像得用魔法。这个你们来解决。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5283": "CORDELIA: 我们试过，可魔法的种类不对。必须用火系魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5284": "NIKOLAI: 是，可我不会魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5285": "CORDELIA: 调整变压器设置，只需一道非常简单的小法术。稍微施一点魔力就够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5286": "NIKOLAI: 听着，不只是法律不许。我是真的用不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5287": "NIKOLAI: 只有军官、政治领袖[oxfordComma /]和医生能用魔法。他们得接受专门训练，再经过升格仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5288": "JEROME: 升格仪式……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5289": "CORDELIA: 我们国家以前也有魔法仪式，不过有的只是法理上的认定，有的则纯属迷信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5290": "CORDELIA: 可自古以来，就有未经许可的民间法师的记载。可见，拥有魔法并不一定非得经过仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5291": "NIKOLAI: 我也不知道该怎么解释。只能另想办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5292": "CORDELIA: 把水壶给我一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5293": "NIKOLAI: 什么？为什么泼我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5294": "CORDELIA: 国王的士兵与臣仆！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5295": "CORDELIA: 在场诸位，共同见证：自今日起，尼古拉·普罗赫将以骑士之身效忠陛下，享有相应的一切权利！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5296": "NIKOLAI: 这就是你们的仪式？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5297": "CORDELIA: 应该是。我只在戏剧里看过。试试是否有效吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5298": "NIKOLAI: 好吧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5299": "NIKOLAI: 不可能这么容易吧？难道……我们整个社会都是建立在……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5300": "CORDELIA: 容易？不。要真正掌握魔法，你得花上一辈子去学。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-nikolaiGainsMagic-5301": "CORDELIA: 这一点，你和其他所有人都一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5302": "COMMANDER: 上士，你来得正好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5303": "NIKOLAI: 长官？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5304": "COMMANDER: 恢复供能，就可以继续实验了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5305": "TECH: 长官，魔力捕获效率约为百分之六十，是新纪录。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5306": "COMMANDER: 干得好，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5307": "COMMANDER: 冯·罗尔主任随时会到，他要看抽取机的演示。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5308": "NIKOLAI: 我得……去检查点东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5309": "JEROME: 爬上发电机，应该就能到天花板的空隙里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5310": "JEROME: 如果他们真制造出骚动，我们就能从那里去外墙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5311": "CORDELIA: 不管怎样，该回家报告这里的所见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5312": "JEROME: 普罗赫先生，你——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5313": "NIKOLAI: 你们知道楼上那机器是干什么的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5314": "NIKOLAI: 别看他！回答我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5315": "CORDELIA: 知道，这正是我们来此的主要原因。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5316": "JEROME: 我们上过一艘船，船上装的全是这类机器的零件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5317": "JEROME: 就这样被一路带到了这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5318": "NIKOLAI: 所以，这些机器来自你们的国家？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5319": "JEROME: 它们的制造……我想，可以算是国家机密。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5320": "CORDELIA: 我第一次知道它存在，就是被绑进去的时候，差点死在里面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5321": "NIKOLAI: 换计划了，有个政府大人物要来看这机器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5322": "NIKOLAI: 等他们启动，我就让它在他眼前炸开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5323": "JEROME: 这么做恐怕过头了，那些囚犯怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5324": "NIKOLAI: 火不会那么快烧到外面的建筑，再说大家都会忙着灭火、保护贵宾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-firstExtraction-5325": "NIKOLAI: 最后的调整我来做，一响起来，你们就动身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-extraction2note-5326": "NIKOLAI: （还差最后一步……靠近机器，确认它已经过热。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5327": "NIKOLAI: （嗯，确实够热，点着管线应该不成问题。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5328": "VON ROHR: 指挥官，你这里的军官，都穿着备用的上士军装走动吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5329": "COMMANDER: 不，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5330": "VON ROHR: 那就是这位上士非法使用了魔法，身上全是痕迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5331": "NIKOLAI: 长官，我们修了一整天发电机，一定是沾上的魔力残留。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5332": "VON ROHR: 我看不是，把他们的军装脱掉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5333": "VON ROHR: 这是……普罗赫？那个叛徒？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5334": "VON ROHR: 命运将你送到这里，要你偿还欠下的债。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5335": "NIKOLAI: 省了那套说辞，直接杀我吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5336": "VON ROHR: 你知道每个人体内都有魔力吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5337": "VON ROHR: 就算不会魔法的人，也还留着那么一点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5338": "VON ROHR: 这台机器，会替帝国把它全部收回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5339": "NIKOLAI: 真以为农民和工人会同意这种事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5340": "VON ROHR: 他们会知道吗？战争与硝烟，让无比伟大的成就成为可能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5341": "VON ROHR: 就先从这个开始，我要让叛徒看清，等着他的是什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5342": "VON ROHR: 启动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5343": "MATEUSZ: 不！帕维尔！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5344": "VON ROHR: 该让你的尸体派上点用场了，普罗赫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5345": "VON ROHR: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5346": "NIKOLAI: 你马上就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5347": "SOLDIER: 站住！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-vonRohrEncounter-5348": "NIKOLAI: 改计划！赶紧逃出去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5349": "CORDELIA: 骚动是有了，可没看见普罗赫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5350": "CORDELIA: 看来他把事情弄得一团糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5351": "JEROME: 我们不知道他遇到了什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5352": "NIKOLAI: 我们来了！该走了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5353": "CORDELIA: 到底发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5354": "NIKOLAI: 没时间解释，马上就有一整个团追过来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5355": "NIKOLAI: 他们来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-campExitScene-5356": "NIKOLAI: 得赶紧找条出去的路！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ch6exit-5357": "NIKOLAI: 要是这门得靠魔法，就指望你们显本事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ch6exit-5358": "CORDELIA: 是有点什么……可与我遇到过的都不同。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-ch6exit-5359": "NIKOLAI: 不管还有什么绝招，现在都该拿出来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsTip-5360": "SOLDIER: 刚到了一批补给，你们既然要下去，里面应该有些东西能派上用场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-gsTip-5361": "SOLDIER: 就在基地东边，装卸台后面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-clothingCheck-5362": "NIKOLAI: 要上楼，就得把军装穿回去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-clothingCheck-5363": "NIKOLAI: 你们两个在这里等着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-clothingCheck2-5364": "NIKOLAI: 不用再穿这些军装了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6End-5365": "要保存游戏吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6End-5366": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/chapter6.yarn-chapter6End-5367": "否"
}
